\
### Step 3: Run the Cloud Run Deploy Command\
Whenever you are ready to update the live website, run this single command in your Terminal:\
\
```bash\
cd ~/Desktop/mock_phone_store\
\
gcloud run deploy mock-phone-store \\\
  --source . \\\
  --project vertex-ai-search-v2 \\\
  --region us-central1 \\\
  --platform managed \\\
  --allow-unauthenticated \\\
  --set-env-vars GCS_BUCKET=agent_live_api_demo\
```\
