### \uc0\u9881 \u65039  What Happens Automatically:\
1. **Cloud Build** automatically packages your new code and local assets into a fresh container image using the `Dockerfile`.\
2. **Cloud Run** creates a new revision and shifts 100% of live traffic to it with **zero downtime**.\
3. Your live URL updates immediately:\
   * \uc0\u55356 \u57104  **[https://mock-phone-store-641879769713.us-central1.run.app](https://mock-phone-store-641879769713.us-central1.run.app)**}